About this file
---------------

This directory runs the stock LXMF Python package (with RNS beneath it, both
pinned) as a black-box interoperability oracle: installed locally, driven
through its public API, its wire output observed. Their source is never read,
and no part of either is copied into or redistributed with this repository.

outrider is an independent implementation of interoperability with LXMF,
built from the public specification prose and wire observation, and is
licensed under MPL-2.0 (see the repository LICENSE). The Reticulum License
below therefore does not attach to outrider's code. It is reproduced here
verbatim in acknowledgment of the upstream projects, and its terms are
honored for the one thing this directory does use the Software for: local
interoperability testing. That use harms nobody and builds no training
dataset.

Both packages carry the same license text, differing only in the copyright
line: LXMF states "Copyright (c) 2020-2025 Mark Qvist" and RNS states
"Copyright (c) 2016-2026 Mark Qvist". The LXMF text follows, unmodified.

